      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p055-05820-s006",
      "sentenceText": "Meanwhile, twenty-five (21.6 percent) were rated to have led a happy life, and sixty-five (56.5 percent) were rated to have led a meaningful life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3ef2135ecee3bfc0b34b7c09c4de02f678d4d589094dc3d2a035361b8d7c970e",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p055-05820-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "e18f749c5e136bd3b050ffe439880ff0a0105d7188fe02e464ed9ff327478ad5",
      "passageSha256": "069da95fc54154f9d9a380f01bd5f979e5fcabe39a774b8f7a3baf4b25d95e56",
      "pdfPages": [
        55,
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p056-01920-s001",
      "sentenceText": "It brings us back to the big question: Is it possible to lead a good life without happiness or meaning?",
      "sentenceSha256": "3aa2e24f9e1ef7081ede1b5f827153f84b15f0d320870fc4048d3224b554b41f",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p056-01920-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "2fed86c07ecf68bb84f646944a0758f75da9bc3af635fdba18434021354dcc9a",
      "passageSha256": "4dca858c0820a274eb549b2273811f1ff4938b488e762e61faac3584f4854e36",
      "pdfPages": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s01-p056-01920-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Goldmund’s life, for example, was probably rated low in happiness and meaning, but high in psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "55ae3fca16c04ad2c5d565f2bccc9bb0539982eb16aed5607a0389c5f621e5d2",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s01-p056-01920-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-017",
      "parentFingerprint": "2fed86c07ecf68bb84f646944a0758f75da9bc3af635fdba18434021354dcc9a",
      "passageSha256": "4dca858c0820a274eb549b2273811f1ff4938b488e762e61faac3584f4854e36",
      "pdfPages": [
        56
      ]
    },
    {
